[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6241.109, "timestamp": "01:44:01", "text": "Picu和我意识到，你觉得Brew怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6244.149, "timestamp": "01:44:04", "text": "可能很危险吗？我的频道将在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6246.87, "timestamp": "01:44:06", "text": "危险之类的，因为是非商业性的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6251.109, "timestamp": "01:44:11", "text": "就是那个东西，对吧？嗯哼。所以当时我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6253.91, "timestamp": "01:44:13", "text": "我记得，就像我喜欢星星一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6256.47, "timestamp": "01:44:16", "text": "因为我以前经常观星"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6258.79, "timestamp": "01:44:18", "text": "孩子。爱流星和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6260.31, "timestamp": "01:44:20", "text": "一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6264.39, "timestamp": "01:44:24", "text": "所以，这就是最初的过程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6267.189, "timestamp": "01:44:27", "text": "灵感来了，你知道，就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6269.109, "timestamp": "01:44:29", "text": "星座"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6272.47, "timestamp": "01:44:32", "text": "像一个实体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6274.629, "timestamp": "01:44:34", "text": "呃，它控制和守护着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6277.59, "timestamp": "01:44:37", "text": "星座和一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6280.709, "timestamp": "01:44:40", "text": "就像那样，那位领主扩张了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6284.149, "timestamp": "01:44:44", "text": "我猜我现在的这个时间是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6287.03, "timestamp": "01:44:47", "text": "更像是舒适的运动内裤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6289.43, "timestamp": "01:44:49", "text": "嗯，这就是为什么连帽衫之类的东西很舒服的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6293.109, "timestamp": "01:44:53", "text": "舒适佩戴类型以及穿孔和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6295.99, "timestamp": "01:44:55", "text": "因为他想融入人群，所以才买了这些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6299.35, "timestamp": "01:44:59", "text": "像个酷酷的人。我猜我不知道。你"}]